  "body": "**Description:**\r\nWith the amount of users growing on the matrix fediverse, people more and more receive unwanted invitations for groups or direct messages. \r\n**Possible approach:**\r\nTo approach this problem, users should get additional settings to automatically reject invitations for groups and, if wished, for direct messages. The inviter should be informed about the automatic rejection.\r\n**Useful side effect:**\r\nAt the same time, the inviter's homeserver could monitor the failed inviting attempts to offer a measurement for fighting spam.",
